{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12332","headline":"观法驾自凤翔回 · 钱起","name":"观法驾自凤翔回","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"欃枪一扫灭，阊阖九重开。\n海晏鲸鲵尽，天旋日月来。\n圣情苏品物，龙御辟云雷。\n晓漏移仙仗，朝阳出帝台。\n周惭散马出，禹让濬川回。\n欲识封人愿，南山举酒杯。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"钱起","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12332.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12332","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}